# SysEdit: Alt then '-' (the frame's menu hands '-' on with WM_MENUCHAR: the active child's system
# menu opens), Next twice (the next child comes to the top and is activated, the old one goes to the
# bottom), then Close (WM_MDIDESTROY: WIN.INI goes, SYSTEM.INI is activated)
# reference: scn/mdi-next.scn (frames 02-05)
# regress: sh apps/sysedit/tests/sysedit.sh "$TEST" "$OUT"
# compare: mdi-next/02.png 02.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# compare: mdi-next/03.png 03.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# compare: mdi-next/04.png 04.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
# compare: mdi-next/05.png 05.png active ignore 316 228 333 261
sleep 500
key alt
key minus
sleep 300
shot shots/02.png
key t
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/03.png
key alt
key minus
key t
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/04.png
key alt
key minus
key c
sleep 300
shotcaret shots/05.png
quit
